{"id":"wb-5-299","name":"文澜阁","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"文澜阁","text":"文澜阁（满语：ᠸᡝᠨᠯᠠᠨᠠᠰᠠᡵᡳ，穆麟德转写：wen lan asari）位于中华人民共和国浙江省杭州市西湖孤山南麓，浙江省博物馆孤山馆区西部。它是清代为珍藏《四库全书》而建的七大藏书阁之一，也是南三阁中唯一幸存的一座。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%96%87%E6%BE%9C%E9%98%81","revisionId":93716733,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93716733","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/56235f97dc340f27a7e3c7a0.jpg","title":"20260425_Wenlan_Pavilion_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260425_Wenlan_Pavilion_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f4/20260425_Wenlan_Pavilion_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​杭州 文澜阁","width":320,"height":213}}